.PP
deletes elements and potentially orphaned nodes if any; parent element storage of the nodes is rebuild and connectivity repaired; input pointers are nulled Erases range of elements not counting null-pointer cells in the supplied sequence, returning the number of genuine erasures\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
