.SS "template<uint32_t dim> \fBvector\fP< \fBInterFace\fP< dim > * > \fBcsmp::MeshManager\fP< dim >::ReplaceFacesByInterFaces (const \fBPropertyDatabase\fP< dim > & dbase, typename std::vector< \fBFace\fP< dim > * >::iterator first, typename std::vector< \fBFace\fP< dim > * >::iterator first_at_boundary, typename std::vector< \fBFace\fP< dim > * >::iterator last, typename std::vector< \fBNode\fP< dim > * >::const_iterator perim_first, typename std::vector< \fBNode\fP< dim > * >::const_iterator perim_last)"

.PP
replaces supplied \fBFace\fP objects with \fBInterFace\fP ones adding necessary nodes and node manifolds, establishing new connectivity; the input Faces are deleted Replaces supplied \fBFace\fP objects with \fBInterFace\fP objects, adding the necessary multiplicated nodes and establishing their connectivity\&. Since the \fBFace\fP objects are deleted the supplied pointer ranges to them (interior and perimeter) are invalidated by this method\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIdbase\fP is needed for the inialisation of the \fBLocalVariableStorage\fP associated with the \fBFace\fP objects
.br
\fIfirst\fP iterator to the first \fBFace\fP of the supplied boundary
.br
